("C32", "Breaker keyed on identical calls only", "Add a ceiling on steps and a tool-name breaker with a measured false-pause rate.", "44", "A circuit breaker stops a run after three identical tool calls. A paginated tool is called with a new page number every time, so the agent requests page after page and the breaker never fires."),
("C33", "Coverage as the only health check of the meter", "Alert on the invoice residual as well as on coverage, with a threshold above the measured noise.", "42", "Tagged coverage of gateway rows stays at 100 percent for a month. A notebook key calling the provider directly spends six percent of the bill and appears in no row, and the invoice residual rises by the same amount."),
